  m_text: 'As the player, you step into the shoes of NEURy ONSel III, also known
    as Norman Eustaquio hUmberto Rigoberto-y Osvaldo Norberto Saturnino-el the Third,
    the neuron of a student whose teacher has given him the task of answering the
    question: How much is 1+1? To do so, our favourite neuron must cross the brain
    to connect with the only surviving neuron other than itself.'
